# ========================
# Claude Code — What to Keep vs. Ignore
# ========================

# KEEP in git (shared with team / useful for the repo):
# ✅ CLAUDE.md         → project standards, commit this
# ✅ .claude/settings.json → shared project-level Claude config

# IGNORE (personal/local only):
# Your personal local Claude overrides
.claude/settings.local.json
# Local task tracking by Claude
.claude/todos/
# Claude's local cache
.claude/cache/

